⚡️🇾🇪🇮🇷 Reuters reports that the Iran’s Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC) helped direct the Houthis’ (Ansar-Allah) latest offensive along Yemen’s Red Sea coast, with Iranian sources saying senior IRGC commanders travelled to Yemen to oversee and assist Houthi attacks.

The Houthis (Ansar-Allah) have seized the port city of Mokha, strengthening their position near the strategic Bab el-Mandeb Strait. Sources also allege that IRGC personnel are assisting the Houthis on the ground.


